# Pairs with NoLostContribution. The saga acknowledges its caller at the
# decision, before any terminal has applied its contribution anywhere.
MODULE: NoLostContributionDecisionAcknowledgesCaller
TARGET: NoLostContribution
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the saga acknowledges its caller at the decision, before any terminal
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
    /\ sg' = "decided"
    /\ UNCHANGED <<row, stamp, clk, migd, owner, leaf, staged, pend, bleaf, told, mg, kind, aAck, bAck>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the decision completes the saga and acknowledges its caller.
    /\ sg' = "done"
    /\ aAck' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<row, stamp, clk, migd, owner, leaf, staged, pend, bleaf, told, mg, kind, bAck>>
--- END